# Copy this file to .env (git-ignored) and fill in real values there — never here.
#
# Rules (CLAUDE.md):
#   - Keys and endpoints are read ONLY inside lab/ experiment scripts.
#     Nothing in docs/ reads this file; the future product reaches providers
#     through the AI gateway, never through a raw key in the environment.
#   - A line is added here in the step whose experiment first needs it, named
#     after the provider that ADR/experiment names — no provider is pre-chosen.
#
# Example shape (commented out until a real experiment needs one):
# <PROVIDER>_API_KEY=
# <PROVIDER>_BASE_URL=
